  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In a July 2025 official statement, Rubio said winning the AI race is non-negotiable and that U.S. dominance in AI is needed to promote prosperity and protect economic and national security. In a June 2026 reported statement, he said AI will have very positive impacts on the economy and societies but will also have some detriments. He also said America is not ready for AI national security threats, noted that the U.S. government had set up a process, and asked how to mitigate or prevent AI dangers. Earlier statements and posts warned about AI-related risks from adversaries, including deepfakes in elections, toothless rules relative to China’s AI efforts, and ByteDance’s AI-powered TikTok algorithm.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2",
